"Years later, Eolinne carries the Heirs to Keihona, and then to Esebus's continent."
"She sails them from Kankus to Helmaris and asks an anti-divination obelisk as her gift."
"Sarya kisses her there; Eolinne does not return the feeling."
"She carries the Heirs on to Ostren and parts from them at Driftmere."
